This sounds to me like an excellent idea. In any case, it would greatly
improve the clarity of the definitions. (See the discussion of {pritu}
in lojban-beginners for an example of such confusion.) The majority of
definitions (that I've looked at) on jbovlaste are currently written in
a highly compressed style, typical of paper dictionaries that just don't
have the space for longer entries.

